{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumSpanningTree(weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"A minimum spanning forest: one minimum spanning tree per connected component.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumSpanningTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanningForest","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/SpanningForest","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees0A6ForestV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edges are ordered by weight, then by position in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"type":"text","text":". Under that order the minimum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spanning forest is unique, and this is it. Its edges are listed in nondecreasing weight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and, among equal weights, in position order, and the weight is added up in that order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Sparse graphs (fewer than 4 edges per vertex) run Kruskal’s algorithm; denser ones run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prim’s under the same order and sort the edges taken."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"text":" gives each edge’s weight from its position, so parallel edges can differ. It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called once for each edge that is not a self-loop and is not kept. Negative, zero and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"infinite weights are ordinary weights. A NaN weight traps; filter such edges out first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(m log m)."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No weight is NaN; the sum of the chosen weights, in the order listed, does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not overflow and is not NaN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumspanningtree(weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"minimumSpanningTree(weight:)","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpanningTrees\/Kruskal.swift#L21","fileName":"Kruskal.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumSpanningTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanningForest","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees0A6ForestV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"SpanningTrees"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P13SpanningTreesE07minimumC4Tree6weightAD0C6ForestVyxqd__Gqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF"},"references":{"doc://SpanningTrees/documentation/SpanningTrees/GraphProtocols/Graph/minimumSpanningTree(weight:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"minimumSpanningTree(weight:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumspanningtree(weight:)","abstract":[{"text":"A minimum spanning forest: one minimum spanning tree per connected component.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Gra